<title>POLAND: KROSNO OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>KROSNO OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.93 vs   0.80</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.85 vs   1.15</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.85 vs   1.09</p>
<p> Sales		   16.01 vs  14.14</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.08 vs   7.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.38 vs  12.03</p>
<p> Operating profit    14.28 vs  14.18</p>
<p> Sales		  150.80 vs 125.68</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is Krosnienskie Huty</p>
<p>Szkla Krosno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
